e1f8914b77fb3baa17fda8b8dbd1bfbf5ceeb1a0ef</id><updated>2026-10-19T21:10:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T08:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/deepfakes-bots-and-distrust-how-ai-is-shaping-israel-s-election/a-79657988--dfb913004f7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/deepfakes-bots-and-distrust-how-ai-is-shaping-israel-s-election/a-79657988?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For the first time, AI is playing a major role in Israel's elections. Observers warn that deepfakes, bots and influence campaigns could sway voters.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: CJP alleges 'deliberate' delay in leaders' release</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:626870e9332383017de15e2562374e79bfc423c1dafe7507a8de63344d621ea3</id><updated>2026-10-19T21:10:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T06:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-cjp-alleges-deliberate-delay-in-leaders-release/live-79695410--74850181e334.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-cjp-alleges-deliberate-delay-in-leaders-release/live-79695410?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">CJP leaders Saurav Das and Ashutosh Ranka were due to be released on Sunday. The judge in the case has recused himself after claiming that he was threatened.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil: Lula, Bolsonaro clash in heated presidential debate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4d67a9ba81ac96c47ea112ef66279792c04328b8ce8076fe08d463559d6f17df</id><updated>2026-10-19T21:10:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T06:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-lula-bolsonaro-clash-in-heated-presidential-debate/a-79695420--08c797da6ef5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-lula-bolsonaro-clash-in-heated-presidential-debate/a-79695420?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The candidates traded barbs, including over Bolsonaro's ties to US President Donald Trump in their first debate, days before the October 25 election runoff.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Macron slams 'failures' over protest unrest in France but refuses interior minister's resignation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f4d5e29c97357efb9060c179c89d9280b06679556c19bbc82ef9e68709e79726</id><updated>2026-10-19T21:10:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T05:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/macron-slams-failures-over-protest-unrest-in-france-but-refuses-interior-minister-s-resignation/a-79695496--07c7a66f2df0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/macron-slams-failures-over-protest-unrest-in-france-but-refuses-interior-minister-s-resignation/a-79695496?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">France's president has refused the resignation of his interior minister, who says police "lost control" during protests that turned violent at the weekend. France's PM has called for limited curfews around the country.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What Earth's sixth mass extinction event means for humans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ab5948144866f121508b46f278adadff194c2ada3278e7ff98d683feccb905e</id><updated>2026-10-19T21:10:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T05:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410--0a12d110aea4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Human activity is driving plants and animals to extinction at an unprecedented rate. As countries meet in Armenia to discuss ways to reverse nature loss, DW reveals how declining biodiversity is already harming people.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
